      ],
      "text": "The repository is a TypeScript/Electron npm-workspaces monorepo with packages for the Electron desktop app, a native SwiftUI iOS app, cross-platform runtime services (AI, sync, Lexical editor), a collab-protocol wire-format package, an extension SDK, and built-in extensions."
    },
