  "summary": "Nimbalyst is described as an open-source, MIT-licensed visual workspace for building with coding agents such as Codex, Claude Code, and OpenCode, shipped as a desktop app for macOS, Windows, and Linux with an iOS companion app. The repository is a TypeScript/Electron npm-workspaces monorepo with packages for the Electron desktop app, a native SwiftUI iOS app, cross-platform runtime services (AI, sync, Lexical editor), a collab-protocol wire-format package, an extension SDK, and built-in extensions.",
  "superseded_claim_ids": []
